---
import SeahawksLayout from "../layouts/SeahawksLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "Privacy Policy";
const pageTagline = "How data is handled on this site";

const updated = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("en-US", {
  timeZone: "America/Los_Angeles",
  dateStyle: "long",
}).format(new Date());
---

<SeahawksLayout pageTitle={pageTitle} pageTagline={pageTagline} activePath="/privacy-policy" monetizationEligible={false}>
  <section class="sfz-card">
    <p class="sfz-updated"><strong>Last updated:</strong> {updated} (Pacific Time)</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Seahawks Fan Zone is a stats-focused fan site. We aim to collect as little personal information as possible.
      This policy explains the site's current support for hosting logs, analytics, and Google advertising. Advertising and
      optional browser analytics are disabled unless configured by the operator and permitted by the applicable consent signal.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we may collect</h2>
    <ul class="sfz-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Basic usage data:</strong> like pages viewed and approximate device information, typically collected via server logs or analytics.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>IP address:</strong> may appear in server logs for security, abuse prevention, and basic diagnostics.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> used for site functionality and, if enabled, advertising and analytics.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      If advertising is enabled after account approval, this site may show ads provided by Google AdSense. Google and its
      third-party advertising vendors may use cookies, local storage, device identifiers, or similar technologies to:
    </p>
    <ul class="sfz-list">
      <li>deliver and measure advertisements</li>
      <li>limit repeated ads</li>
      <li>report aggregated performance metrics</li>
      <li>in some cases, personalize ads based on your interests</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Depending on your location and choices, Google may serve personalized or non-personalized ads. Where consent is required,
      advertising does not load until the configured Google-certified consent management platform reports the required consent.
      Rejecting optional consent does not prevent access to site content.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      If configured and permitted by your consent choice, this site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand page usage and
      improve performance. Optional browser analytics is not loaded before the centralized consent state allows it. The hosting
      provider may separately process request information in server logs for delivery, security, abuse prevention, and diagnostics.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are small text files stored by your browser. Local storage is another way a browser can retain information on a
      device. Google, its vendors, and the configured consent platform may use these technologies for consent choices, ad delivery,
      frequency limits, fraud prevention, measurement, and personalization. This site does not create a separate custom consent cookie.
    </p>

    <h3 id="privacy-choices">Your privacy choices</h3>
    <p>
      Use <a href="#" data-manage-privacy>Manage Privacy Choices</a> in the footer at any time to reopen the configured consent
      platform and change or withdraw a choice. If the control redirects back here, the production consent platform is not configured.
      You may also use browser controls and Google's ad settings; browser restrictions can affect site or advertising features.
    </p>

    <h3>Sharing and third-party vendors</h3>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal information. Information may be processed by service providers only as needed to operate the site,
      including hosting providers, Cloudflare when analytics is enabled, Google, and Google's advertising vendors when advertising is enabled.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      This site may link to external sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not intended for children under 13. If you believe a child has provided personal information, contact us and we will address it.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have privacy questions, contact: <a href="mailto:laura@caferacerstudios.com">laura@caferacerstudios.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .sfz-card {
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 34, 68, 0.14);
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 1rem 1.05rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      margin-bottom: 0.95rem;
    }

    .sfz-updated {
      margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
      color: rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.65);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .sfz-card h2 {
      margin: 0.9rem 0 0.55rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .sfz-card p {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      color: rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.78);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .sfz-list {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      color: rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.75);
      line-height: 1.55;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .sfz-list li {
      margin: 0.3rem 0;
    }

    .sfz-muted {
      color: rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.6);
      font-weight: 650;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  </style>
</SeahawksLayout>
